gory":"Breakfast & Brunch","historical_business_count":1}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Breakfast & Brunch, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"yMlpyzvx5o3tTFI_1esgGQ","review_id":"1fTvQl6SaxChm_1gTrUgRA","date":"2019-06-30T00:19:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9555854797363281,"text_excerpt":"I loved loved loved the Bakery Bar! It's a nice cozy spot with a very friendly atmosphere. We enjoyed our small bits of shrimp dip and a charcuterie board. I also had my favorite drink ... a Brandy Milk Punch! Of course, the highlight of our visit was the bakery! I went there to try the doberge cake! Definitely save lots of room for dessert! I plan to go back soon!!!"},{"business_id":"yMlpyzvx5o3tTFI_1esgGQ","review_id":"bNjftAscQD1JKktcQS27-w","date":"2016-12-22T17:25:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9473775029182434,"text_excerpt":"I can't believe it took me so long to check this place out! I came here for drinks and desserts with a friend on a Tuesday night. All in all, I really enjoyed my experience. The drinks were reasonably priced for a nicer bar ($8-$10 for a glass of wine), the staff was very friendly, and I enjoyed the atmosphere. I see that they have some games so I will need to show up ready to play games next time! You order food and drinks at the bar and then they have a big case with all of their dessert options. They have doberge cake slices for $7, dobites for $3 and salty balls for $1.50. I ordered a salted caramel dobite since my friend didn't want to share dessert and I enjoyed it! The cake itself ..."},{"business_id":"yMlpyzvx5o3tTFI_1esgGQ","review_id":"OFAqjOnye0z_0tHYxkbs-A","date":"2017-11-15T16:39:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9462846517562866,"text_excerpt":"I have a huge sweet tooth, and I LOVE the bakery bar. The space inside feels very inviting, they made it into a great place to hang out and have some drinks and dessert. They have shelves to read and plenty of board games to play with your friends. The dobites and salty balls are my favorite, they're somehow moist and sweet but not overly so, and then enveloped in chocolate or frosting. The perfect size to just pop in your mouth. Other than all their cakes they also have a dessert menu and a deep fried chocolate chip cookie, seriously, it's so good. It's basically a chocolate chip cookie wrapped in pastry deep fried and covered in powdered sugar, so like a beignet with a cookie inside. I'..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yMlpyzvx5o3tTFI_1esgGQ","photo_id":"D-35mIFv7OEAzBMixxqeBA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/D-35mIFv7OEAzBMixxqeBA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8705730438232422},{"business_id":"yMlpyzvx5o3tTFI_1esgGQ","photo